{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/nfsw8ekm5owashivclgk8cm14uf395v.mp3","text":"要听点音乐吗？我的耳机就借你一会儿吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/grxdk22km1txq4s8g3k7h7ovd85tv36.mp3","text":"抱歉，请和我保持一点距离。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/qi1kedowtw2cdcz57p011333miirnj0.mp3","text":"我从没想过，自己会有从事救援工作的这一天。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/0g9onvl01putlvahc83lyjog2xelc8r.mp3","text":"挥舞这把斧头的时间，说不定比我识字的时间都长。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/ssqca63un6sxmlu753az658xfuv6d78.mp3","text":"我喜欢的歌，应该也不怎么流行吧。这些歌只适合独处的时候哼给自己听。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/a96kp5q1wf762d34c0saoy2fupgzls0.mp3","text":"不要眨眼。见证这战技的机会，只有这一瞬间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/9jvd8fbbb26r7anpfmexrvq99tmhzxr.mp3","text":"喝点吗，我请。工作结束之后，还是稍微放松一会儿比较好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/t0i99wx8nybflff6gl1oe7ca2tzdgjj.mp3","text":"直到身边的人接连逝去，我才意识到作为人去活着的可贵。很讽刺吧？呵，我也觉得。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/gfmibzt3hls1i1sww7i6kknqkjntq43.mp3","text":"佣兵不过是种工作，出于什么目的、造成什么后果，并不由我决定。以后，这种“我该担负什么责任”的考量，就交给你了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/5euj0djhgpz64zj8y3nn4cnvkdybnju.mp3","text":"哼——哼哼♪哼......哼哼......♪","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/kclp4ubaz88j03ed6wpfntea5zca90h.mp3","text":"霜叶，前佣兵，现在，是你的干员。随意调遣我吧，我什么都能做。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/dctvpo8051kztue345u0iuty1f7nimu.mp3","text":"谢谢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/eiw5g2gwpn9vt9r8649z7xmj8aq6yn5.mp3","text":"提上正轨了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/bpd38ufq64cbn469ns8v33z28tvej51.mp3","text":"呼......也不错。久违的充实感。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/tfzywivce1wloh2db31accvlto8d0aw.mp3","text":"我会履行自己的义务。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/9cfbgih5e3sap3egjkrhzazt2l92tyz.mp3","text":"各行其道，各尽其职。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/jzz82nc2if6fcyvj6gw6vq7tilus20n.mp3","text":"正好，我也想活动下身体了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/sfa4uiu88iyquli8i825ryz8a7d1too.mp3","text":"支离破碎吧——！","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/swee33aha0nsr9o79tk5mszzwo623j4.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/fnwnn0289cq7vbn6297dfojywt5n68c.mp3","text":"有什么命令？","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/m1t4xnoe8yrjllo42s6a9qkki9kxepa.mp3","text":"这样就可以了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/9jjvrsn2nq0d18pqwahwu5wmun5po7h.mp3","text":"唔，可以。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/agtbbwf7bfbavvw5m4623mv9qot3two.mp3","text":"寒冷，不止我的体液。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/e5tpz2u0epwi6lp9poihia3ax1l0yve.mp3","text":"延伸我的锋芒吧——！","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/ki0b9ugjr5jsmwdlpxr3gz1ddf7bfkg.mp3","text":"凡有生气，尽都如草。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/53/d70j86dgv67rawv4su8ag21eujd39za.mp3","text":"让头脑清醒点吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/4lhvve1tjbixk42zzgfpe3axy05xpa7.mp3","text":"战争尽头的荒芒，已不知道经历了多少次。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/aml8se2jgs8tkreljsof78uqpuwyklh.mp3","text":"我记得每一个敌人。一个逃走的也没有。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/eq2q3n3ti7dpb4880mumzogfsu75ckc.mp3","text":"没有损失人手吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/2b1fe4sckhzf9q3sc3e61pjuzcnz5xf.mp3","text":"我来断后......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/0xf3eam1kafycq0xxajlk9klitga2bw.mp3","text":"想要比较......私人一点的空间呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/6byi24zq1yvmdxos3rvs2a3qo3tes12.mp3","text":"唔呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/avqxdqcegj00tjy1kesbapwdeg3jznu.mp3","text":"一起去喝一杯吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/hlmwvay2s86rs8am5n30yo6mud898s0.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/q54cwq6ljtq2pk49j7cmsa0etllcw8z.mp3","text":"在来罗德岛之前，我从来没有庆祝过这样的节日。新年？即便没有工作，也不会有这样温暖安全的房间。我可以自己先听一会儿音乐吗？等我一下......待会儿会来找你的，博士。谢谢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/tgvfczim7eh0upapw4wy0gh7ldlte0w.mp3","text":"博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_193_frostl/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/kndeesoj3la8nmc6hfib80236ac03z5.mp3","text":"要听点音乐吗？我的耳机就借你一会儿吧。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/lzya5sao78v8svrb7qg2hmsxmz5a03n.mp3","text":"抱歉，请和我保持一点距离。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/bwmkf5r5lrwnessu1fpgeq2tr5chu1j.mp3","text":"我从没想过，自己会有从事救援工作的这一天。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/sjjxzeesh6042xkphvaa9qvhdj0vld8.mp3","text":"挥舞这把斧头的时间，说不定比我识字的时间都长。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/hv9pqypeksbrgq6xm65716bwu5611xq.mp3","text":"我喜欢的歌，应该也不怎么流行吧。这些歌只适合独处的时候哼给自己听。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/ksjzxfrndbu6y7e86gefvbz7etd05b9.mp3","text":"不要眨眼。见证这战技的机会，只有这一瞬间。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/okhdmrzah0mv81wm69bonkeugvr633u.mp3","text":"喝点吗，我请。工作结束之后，还是稍微放松一会儿比较好。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/1c7qrsfqjrcohc4peiga8yztydvidv3.mp3","text":"直到身边的人接连逝去，我才意识到作为人去活着的可贵。很讽刺吧？呵，我也觉得。","alt":"voice/char_193_frostl/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/af/jmhziih4rsmkpf8d3uyj7klxb6vx5az.mp3","text":"佣兵不过是种工作，出于什么目的、造成什么后果，并不